<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Plans</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Free for 30 days. Then one price per business.</h1><p class="lede fade">Request a free NEVORA trial for your team, with no card and no automatic charge. On day 30 you choose what happens next.</p><div class="acts fade"><a class="pill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora-demo{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora-demo{% endif %}">Request free trial</a><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora{% endif %}">Ask for a quote</a></div></div></section><section class="plans"><div class="wrap"><dl class="spec big"><div><dt>Free trial</dt><dd>30 days<small>From the day we set up your workplace</small></dd></div><div><dt>Team size</dt><dd>Up to 30 employees<small>Larger teams by quote</small></dd></div><div><dt>Card</dt><dd>None<small>No automatic charge on day 30</small></dd></div><div><dt>After the trial</dt><dd>One price per&nbsp;business<small>Quoted for your number of employees, your business and the features you use</small></dd></div></dl><div class="inc"><p class="hkick">Included</p><h2 class="t2 rise">Everything in the trial stays in the plan.</h2><ul class="checks"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>Scheduling and shift swaps</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>