>NEVORA calculates pay statements; it does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.</p></div><div class="inc"><p class="hkick">Day 30</p><h2 class="t2 rise">Two ways the trial can end.</h2><ol class="rail r2" data-in><li data-in><i>01</i><b>Continue by quote</b><span>We price NEVORA for your business and your team keeps working without interruption.</span></li><li data-in><i>02</i><b>Close the workplace</b><span>Export your schedules, timecards and pay statements first. Email support@thevelani.com to close it. We then delete the workplace and its data within 3 days.</span></li></ol><div class="acts"><a class="pill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora-demo{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora-demo{% endif %}">Request free trial</a><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora{% endif %}">Ask for a quote</a></div><p class="hfact">No card required · No automatic charge</p></div><div class="inc"><p class="hkick">Websites and custom apps</p><h2 class="t2 rise">Quoted per project.</h2><p class="lede">A written proposal after a first conversation: what we build, what it costs and the milestones. Paid work starts only after you agree to it.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=custom-software{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=custom-software{% endif %}">Start a project</a></div></div></div></section><section class="hpanel end" id="velani" aria-label="Velani"><img class="hph flip" src="{{ 'night-ai-light.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hwm"><svg class="wm-velani" viewBox="0.0 689.0 1957.0 350.6" fill="currentCol